    ["<Assistant_Title1>【公证书】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本倾向封印物，施放职业技能时会进行公证，成功后提升该<Assistant_Red>技能等级</>，超过等级上限时转化为本次技能的伤害或治疗加成；公证失败时会降低该<Assistant_Red>技能等级</>，并使该技能本次造成的<Assistant_Red>伤害</>和<Assistant_Red>治疗</>效果降低。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Notarization Certificate】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A dungeon-oriented Sealed Artifact. When casting a class skill, it will perform a notarization; upon success, it increases the level of that <Assistant_Red>skill</>. If it exceeds the level cap, it converts into damage or healing bonuses for that skill. If the notarization fails, it reduces the level of that <Assistant_Red>skill</> and decreases the <Assistant_Red>damage</> and <Assistant_Red>healing</> effects of that skill for this instance.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default; no additional acquisition required.",
    ["<Dungeon_Highlight>击败敌人</>，马车才能继续前进"] = "<Dungeon_Highlight> Defeat the enemies </> so the carriage can continue moving forward.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\">洗牌</>需要的<HighLight>卡牌能量</>减少1点，并且伤害基础值提高20%，第一击有90%概率<HighLight>禁锢</>目标，持续0.8秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每隔45秒获得<HighLight>灵性预警</>，可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Shuffle Cards </> requires 1 less <HighLight> Card Energy </>, and base damage is increased by 20%. The first hit has a 90% chance to <HighLight> Imprison </> the target for 0.8 seconds. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Reveal Card </> grants <HighLight> Spirituality Warning </> every 45 seconds, which can remove one control effect and increases movement speed by 25% for 2 seconds upon triggering.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得200绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷1</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      欢迎您来到这片交织隐秘与启示的世界，愿灵性为您指引前路。\n      尽管这是初次步入此间，但您或许已经对眼前徐徐展开的世界有了独特的感知与构想。我们始终以敬畏之心观察并记录着一切——您在此间每一瞬的所见、所思与所感，在我们看来皆是珍贵的启示。在此，我们诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，向我们传达您的想法。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 200 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 1</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      Welcome to this world intertwined with secrets and revelations. May your spirituality guide your path. \n      Although this is your first time stepping into this place, you may already have unique perceptions and ideas about the world unfolding before you. We always observe and record everything with awe—every moment of what you see, think, and feel here is a precious revelation to us. Here, we sincerely invite you to convey your thoughts to us through the secret channel in the letter. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来有心灵领域的官方非凡者关注并管控着报刊行业，吉尔达的记忆和心智受到了干扰。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems official Beyonders from the Mind domain are monitoring and controlling the newspaper industry; Gilda's memory and mind have been tampered with.)</>",
    ["<Title>复活次数加成</>\n队伍或团队中，3~8人处于同一家族，获得1次额外复活次数；9人以上处于同一家族，获得2次额外复活次数。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。\n<Title>属性补足加成</>\n队伍或团队中，拥有相同家族成员时，获得属性增益。团队内同家族成员数量越多，增益效果越高。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "<Title>Resurrection Count Bonus</>\nIf 3–8 people in a party or team belong to the same Family, gain 1 extra resurrection attempt; if 9 or more people belong to the same Family, gain 2 extra resurrection attempts. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.\n<Title>Attribute Supplement Bonus</>\nIf there are members of the same Family in a party or team, gain attribute bonuses. The more members of the same Family in the team, the higher the bonus effect. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.",
